   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "放放松，发发呆",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/40238",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=40238",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"40238\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "休息和用餐区里的舒适椅子令人一坐下就不想起来。而凉棚则能划分出特定的空间，在后花园营造出家般的温馨氛围。",
    "放放松，发发呆"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/18418f34c5e8e356/original/PH176861-crop002.jpg"
