  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "户外厨房",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/24898",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=24898",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"24898\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "有了模块化的户外厨房，再也不怕下厨时错失乐趣。齐全的烹饪和用餐工具，触手可及，这样你就能一边下厨，一边继续和大家聊天，当然还能同时照看孩子。",
    "户外厨房"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/48b679c167c28934/original/PH176862-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/24898",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/48b679c167c28934/original/PH176862-crop001.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一个靠窗靠墙的黑色户外厨房，有一个烤架、水槽，还有放着餐具和炊具的搁架。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/48b679c167c28934/original/PH176862-crop001.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
