  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "热腾腾的食物和清新的空气，享受美好时光",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/24898",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=24898",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"24898\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这个碳烤炉的烧烤面积很大，方便你用更少的时间，烤制更多食物。碳烤炉下方有充足的储物空间，可以用来放托盘和餐具，近在手边。",
    "热腾腾的食物和清新的空气，享受美好时光"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2bd43c4db292c69b/original/PH176863-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/24898",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2bd43c4db292c69b/original/PH176863-crop001.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一种碳烤炉，烟罩打开着，烤架上放着蔬菜串。下方的搁板上放着一些托盘和盘子。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2bd43c4db292c69b/original/PH176863-crop001.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
