  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "舒适的休闲区",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/21959",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=21959",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"21959\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这款户外沙发不怕日晒，也能抵御各种天气。由塑料藤制成，易于维护。在沙发上摆放几个彩色靠垫，就能打造一个舒适而有格调的户外休闲区。",
    "舒适的休闲区"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/33f47a0aef558eb9/original/PH176864-crop002.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/21959",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/33f47a0aef558eb9/original/PH176864-crop002.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一个休闲区，其中有一张带炭黑色靠垫的深灰色户外沙发、一张米色茶几、地板饰面和盆栽植物。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/33f47a0aef558eb9/original/PH176864-crop002.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
