  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "玩足一整天",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/37899",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=37899",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"37899\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "一个让孩子（和大人！）乐在其中的空间应该是这样的：一张可以用来做游戏和用餐的儿童野餐桌，一个可以折叠成休闲椅或矮躺椅的懒人沙发；当然还要有一把阳伞，这样多玩几小时也不怕晒伤。",
    "玩足一整天"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3115b9aa7e009de5/original/PH176865-crop002.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/37899",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3115b9aa7e009de5/original/PH176865-crop002.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "户外空间有绿色人造草坪地板饰面、一个带靠垫的灰色懒人沙发、一张儿童野餐桌和一把米色大阳伞。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3115b9aa7e009de5/original/PH176865-crop002.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
